  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>170</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Áp dụng định lý sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>762</mn><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>170</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>306</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>458</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy thời gian bạn An đi từ nhà tới trường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>306</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>458</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">giờ</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">phút</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
